{"title":"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A sports team earns 2 points for each win, 0 points for each loss, and 1 point for each tie. How many points does the team earn for 9 wins, 3 losses and 4 ties?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78d1894d40cc1d0eb136234e64fd401435e1c6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   26  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   16  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   19  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   21 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   22  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because each win earns the team <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points, the team earns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/34708f8c5906bb1bdc89f30ea8412e8b03ba1c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 9 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> points from the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> wins.\n</p><p>The losses don't affect the number of points, as the team earns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points for each loss.\n</p><p>Because each tie earns the team <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> point, the team earns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points from the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ties.\n</p><p>Thus, the team earns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5ee40d28a85f0bb3f798561ffc8050f2ae662d10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18 + 4 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" /> points.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" 